  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your link to your patron allows you to serve as a conduit for radiant energy. You have Resistance to Radiant damage. Once per turn, when a spell you cast deals Radiant or Fire damage, you can add your Charisma modifier to that spell’s damage against one of the spell’s targets.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-svyjVvard8Z17Yjz\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>As you level up you will automatically be granted the Resistance to Radiant damage.</p><p>The <strong>Damage</strong> activity includes a damage roll that allows you to select the damage type in the roll's dialog. Alternatively, you can add your Charisma modifier in the Spell's Situational Bonus field when rolling damage.</p></section>",
